msgid "Keep all Advagg settings but disable all functionality."
msgstr "保留所有 Advagg 設定，但停用所有功能。"

msgid "Restore all Advagg functionality if disabled."
msgstr "還原所有 Advagg 功能（如果已停用）。"

msgid "Run the advagg cron hook. This will clear out all stale advagg aggregated files, remove aggregates that include missing files, and remove unused aggregates."
msgstr "執行 advagg cron 連結鉤。 這將清除所有陳舊的 advagg 聚集檔案、移除包括遺漏檔案的聚集，以及移除未用的聚集。"

msgid "Remove all generated files. Useful if you think some of the generated files got corrupted and thus need to be deleted."
msgstr "移除所有產生的檔案。 如果您認為部分產生的檔案已毀損而需要加以刪除，則這是很有用的。"

msgid "Force the creation of all new optimized files by incrementing a global counter. Current value of counter: %value. This is may be useful if a CDN has cached an something incorrectly as it will force new ones to be used even if nothing else has changed."
msgstr "強制透過增加廣域計數器來建立所有新的最佳化檔案。 計數器的現行值：%value。 如果 CDN 不正確地快取了某個項目，則這可能很有用，因為即使未變更任何其他內容，也會強制使用新內容。"

msgid "Run the advagg cron hook."
msgstr "執行 advagg cron 連結鉤。"

msgid "Disable Advagg."
msgstr "停用 Advagg。"

msgid "Enable Advagg."
msgstr "啟用 Advagg。"

msgid "Remove all generated files."
msgstr "移除所有產生的檔案。"

msgid "Force the creation of all new files by incrementing a global counter."
msgstr "強制透過增加廣域計數器來建立所有新檔案。"

msgid "All Advagg functionality is disabled."
msgstr "已停用所有 Advagg 功能。"

msgid "All Advagg functionality is enabled."
msgstr "已啟用所有 Advagg 功能。"

msgid "Global counter is now set to @new_value"
msgstr "廣域計數器現在設定為 @new_value"

msgid "All AdvAgg optimized files have been deleted. %css_count CSS files and %js_count JS files have been removed."
msgstr "已刪除所有 AdvAgg 最佳化檔案。已移除 %css_count CSS 檔及 %js_count JS 檔。"

msgid "All stale aggregates have been deleted. %css_count CSS files and %js_count JS files have been removed."
msgstr "已刪除所有舊聚集。已移除 %css_count CSS 檔及 %js_count JS 檔。"

msgid "No stale aggregates found. Nothing was deleted."
msgstr "找不到陳舊聚集。 未刪除任何內容。"

msgid "NOTE: If you wish to bypass AdvAgg optimizations for a set amount of time, you can go to the <a href=\"@operations\">AdvAgg operations</a> page and press the <em>\"optimization bypass cookie\"</em> button."
msgstr "附註：如果您想要在設定的時間量內略過 AdvAgg 最佳化，您可以移至 <a href=\"@operations\">AdvAgg 作業</a>頁面，然後按<em>「最佳化略過 Cookie」</em>按鈕。"

msgid "You can also selectively bypass AdvAgg optimization by adding <code>@code</code> to the URL of any page."
msgstr "您也可以透過將 <code>@code</code> 新增至任何頁面的 URL，選擇性地略過 AdvAgg 最佳化。"

msgid "You do not have the <a href=\"@permission\">bypass advanced aggregation permission</a> so adding <code>@code</code> to the URL will not work at this time for you; either grant this permission to your user role or use the bypass cookie if you wish to selectively bypass AdvAgg optimizations."
msgstr "您沒有<a href=\"@permission\">略過進階聚集許可權</a>，因此，您目前無法將 <code>@code</code> 新增至 URL；如果您想要選擇性地略過 AdvAgg 最佳化，請將此許可權授與您的使用者角色，或使用略過 Cookie。"

msgid "The AdvAgg bypass cookie is currently enabled. Turn it off by going to the <a href=\"@advagg_operations\">AdvAgg Operations</a> page and clicking the <em>Toggle the \"aggregation bypass cookie\" for this browser</em> button."
msgstr "目前已啟用 AdvAgg 略過 Cookie。 移至 <a href=\"@advagg_operations\">AdvAgg 作業</a>頁面，然後按一下<em>切換此瀏覽器的「聚集略過 Cookie」</em>按鈕，以關閉它。"

msgid "The AdvAgg bypass cookie is currently enabled. Turn it off by <a href=\"@login\">logging in</a> with a user with the \"administer site configuration\" permissions and going to the <a herf=\"@advagg_operations\">AdvAgg Operations page</a> and clicking the <em>Toggle the \"aggregation bypass cookie\" for this browser</em> button."
msgstr "目前已啟用 AdvAgg 略過 Cookie。 透過<a href=\"@login\">以具有「管理網站配置」許可權的使用者身分登入</a>，並移至 <a herf=\"@advagg_operations\">AdvAgg 作業頁面</a>，然後按一下<em>切換此瀏覽器的「聚集略過 Cookie」</em>按鈕，以關閉它。"

msgid "0 sec"
msgstr "0 秒"

msgid "AdvAgg Bypass Cookie Removed"
msgstr "已移除 AdvAgg 略過 Cookie"

msgid "AdvAgg Bypass Cookie Set for @time."
msgstr "已針對 @time 設定 AdvAgg 略過 Cookie。"

