msgid "Global Options"
msgstr "廣域選項"

msgid "Enable advanced aggregation"
msgstr "啟用進階聚集"

msgid "Uncheck this box to temporarily disable AdvAgg functionality."
msgstr "取消勾選此方框以暫時停用 AdvAgg 功能。"

msgid "Use DNS Prefetch for external CSS/JS."
msgstr "使用外部 CSS/JS 的 DNS 預先提取。"

msgid "Start the DNS lookup for external CSS and JavaScript files as soon as possible."
msgstr "請儘快啟動外部 CSS 及 JavaScript 檔案的 DNS 查閱。"

msgid "Server Config"
msgstr "伺服器配置"

msgid "Cache-Control: Immutable"
msgstr "Cache-Control: Immutable"

msgid "Your server can send <a href=\"@url1\">Cache-Control: immutable</a> header for all optimized files. This should improve performance for some users. Current <a href=\"@url2\">browser support</a>"
msgstr "您的伺服器可以傳送所有最佳化檔案的 <a href=\"@url1\">Cache-Control: immutable</a> 標頭。 這應該會改進部分使用者的效能。 現行<a href=\"@url2\">瀏覽器支援</a>"

msgid "Include Cache-Control: immutable in generated .htaccess files."
msgstr "在產生的 .htaccess 檔案中包含 Cache-Control: immutable。"

msgid "With the Apache server, AdvAgg can generate config to send the header for all optimized files."
msgstr "使用 Apache 伺服器時，AdvAgg 可以產生配置來傳送所有最佳化檔案的標頭。"

msgid "With Nginx, AdvAgg can't set the headers for optimized files in a performant manner. However, you can easily do so in your server config. See the <a href='@url'>manual for instructions</a>."
msgstr "使用 Nginx 時， AdvAgg 無法以高效能方式設定最佳化檔案的標頭。 不過，您可以在伺服器配置中輕鬆執行此作業。 請參閱<a href='@url'>手冊以取得指示</a>。"

msgid "AdvAgg Cache Settings"
msgstr "AdvAgg 快取設定"

msgid "No performance data yet but most use cases will probably want to use the Normal cache mode."
msgstr "尚未有效能資料，但大部分使用案例都可能想要使用「正常」快取模式。"

msgid "Compression Options"
msgstr "壓縮選項"

msgid "Compressed files will automatically be served by the Apache server"
msgstr "將自動由 Apache 伺服器來處理壓縮檔"

msgid "AdvAgg can't configure your Nginx server to automatically serve compressed assets. See the <a href='@url'>AdvAgg manual</a> for instructions on manually doing so."
msgstr "AdvanAgg 無法配置 Nginx 伺服器以自動處理壓縮資產。 如需手動執行此作業的相關指示，請參閱 <a href='@url'>AdvanAgg 手冊</a>。"

msgid "Gzip CSS assets"
msgstr "Gzip CSS 資產"

msgid "This should be enabled unless you are experiencing corrupted compressed asset files."
msgstr "除非您遇到毀損的壓縮資產檔案，否則應該啟用此項。"

msgid "Gzip JavaScript assets"
msgstr "Gzip JavaScript 資產"

msgid "Select to compress this asset type with brotli compression. See <a href='https://github.com/kjdev/php-ext-brotli'>PHP Brotli</a> page for more information."
msgstr "選取此項以使用 brotli 壓縮來壓縮此資產類型。 如需相關資訊，請參閱 <a href='https://github.com/kjdev/php-ext-brotli'>PHP Brottli</a> 頁面。"

msgid "Brotli compression is not available on your server. See <a href='https://github.com/kjdev/php-ext-brotli'>PHP Brotli</a> page for more information."
msgstr "無法在您的伺服器上使用 Brotli 壓縮。 如需相關資訊，請參閱 <a href='https://github.com/kjdev/php-ext-brotli'>PHP Brottli</a> 頁面。"

msgid "Brotli compress CSS assets"
msgstr "Brotli 壓縮 CSS 資產"

msgid "Brotli compress JavaScript assets"
msgstr "Brotli 壓縮 JavaScript 資產"

msgid "CSS Options"
msgstr "CSS 選項"

msgid "Combine CSS files by using media queries"
msgstr "使用媒體查詢來結合 CSS 檔案"

msgid "Will combine more CSS files together because different CSS media types can be used in the same file by using media queries. Use cores grouping logic needs to be unchecked in order for this to work. Also noted is that due to an issue with IE9, compatibility mode is forced off if this is enabled."
msgstr "使用媒體查詢將更多的 CSS 檔案結合在一起，因為可在同一檔案中使用不同的 CSS 媒體類型。 必須取消勾選使用核心分組邏輯，此功能才能運作。 另請注意，由於 IE9 發生問題，如果啟用此選項，則會強制關閉相容模式。"

msgid "Fix improperly set type"
msgstr "修正未正確設定的類型"

msgid "If type is external but does not start with http, https, or // change it to be type file. If type is file but it starts with http, https, or // change type to be external. Note that if this is causing issues, odds are you have a double slash when there should be a single; see <a href=\"@link\">this issue</a>"
msgstr "如果類型是外部，但開頭不是 http、https 或 //，請將它變更為類型檔案。 如果類型是檔案，但開頭是 http、https 或 //，請將類型變更為外部。 請注意，如果這樣做會導致問題，則在應為單一斜線時，可能會出現雙斜線；請參閱<a href=\"@link\">這個問題</a>"

msgid "Do not change external to file if on same host."
msgstr "如果在相同的主機上，請勿將外部變更為檔案。"

msgid "If a CSS file is set as external and is on the same hosts do not convert to file."
msgstr "如果 CSS 檔設為外部，且位於相同的主機上，請勿轉換為檔案。"

msgid "JS Options"
msgstr "JS 選項"

msgid "If a JS file is set as external and is on the same hosts do not convert to file."
msgstr "如果 JS 檔案設為外部，且位於相同的主機上，請勿轉換為檔案。"

msgid "Cron Options"
msgstr "Cron 選項"

msgid "Unless you have a good reason to adjust these values you should leave them alone."
msgstr "除非您有一個好的理由來調整這些值，否則您應保留這些值。"

msgid "@time ago"
msgstr "@time 前"

msgid "never"
msgstr "永不"

msgid "The default value for this is %value. The last time advagg_cron was ran is %time."
msgstr "此值的預設值為 %value。 前次執行 advagg_cron 的時間是 %time。"

msgid "The default value for this is %value."
msgstr "此值的預設值為 %value。"

msgid "Obscure Options"
msgstr "遮蔽選項"

msgid "Some of the more obscure AdvAgg settings. Odds are you do not need to change anything in here."
msgstr "部分較為遮蔽的 AdvAgg 設定。 您可能無需變更這裡的任何內容。"

msgid "Convert absolute paths to be protocol relative paths."
msgstr "將絕對路徑轉換成通訊協定相對路徑。"

msgid "If the src to a CSS/JS file points starts with http:// or https://, convert it to use a protocol relative path //. Will also convert url() references inside of css files."
msgstr "如果指向 CSS/JS 檔案點的 SRC 以 http:// 或 https:// 開頭，請將它轉換成使用通訊協定相對路徑 //。 也會轉換 css 檔案內的 url() 參照。"

msgid "Convert relative paths to be absolute paths."
msgstr "將相對路徑轉換成絕對路徑。"

msgid "If the src to a CSS/JS file points starts with a relative path / convert to absolute."
msgstr "如果指向 CSS/JS 檔案點的 SRC 以相對路徑 / 開頭，請將它轉換成絕對路徑。"

msgid "Convert http:// to https://."
msgstr "將 http:// 轉換成 https://。"

msgid "If the src to a CSS/JS file starts with http:// convert it https://. Will also convert url() references inside of css files."
msgstr "如果指向 CSS/JS 檔案的 SRC 以 http:// 開頭，請將它轉換成 https://。 也會轉換 css 檔案內的 url() 參照。"

msgid "Use \"Options +FollowSymLinks\""
msgstr "使用「選項 +FollowSymLinks」"

msgid "Some shared hosts require \"<code>Options +FollowSymLinks</code>\" in the .htaccess for asset directories."
msgstr "部分共用主機需要資產目錄 .htaccess 中的「<code>選項 +FollowSymLinks</code>」。"

msgid "Use \"Options +SymLinksIfOwnerMatch\""
msgstr "使用「選項 +SymLinksIfOwnerMatch」"

msgid "Some shared hosts require \"<code>Options +SymLinksIfOwnerMatch</code>\" in the .htaccess for asset directories."
msgstr "部分共用主機在資產目錄的 .htaccess 中需要「<code>選項 +SymLinksIfOwnerMatch</code>」。"

